# ==================================================================
#  GAME LEVELS: the levels that are built from a .level file
#  One line per level: its name | its file (in this folder).
#  The name is the level's name in its world (levels.dat), or island-level for the campaign (reef-3).
#  A file that isn't listed here is never loaded.
# ==================================================================

Hedgerow | labyrinth-1.level
Catacombs | labyrinth-2.level
The Coil | labyrinth-3.level

